  "description": "Anyone who approached Seungjeong, a ‘bitch born by eating her mother’ and a ‘cursed bitch’, became injured or seriously ill, regardless of whether they were humans or animals. Is this the work of an evil spirit or not? Seungjeong's last remaining hope lies in Youndang, an herbalist shop rumored to be haunted by monsters. Would it be possible to lift the curse there?",
